      "lifecycle": "new client deployment starts Report-only"
    },
    "rule": "The canonical allowed-countries object and saved travel/partner decisions own tenant scope. Travel is handled by time-bounded changes to the allowed-countries location, never by ad-hoc user exclusion. Never copy source-tenant group/location IDs."
  },
